        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing Innovative Gameplay: Big Bomb Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that mysterious Minesweeper on your old computer? It’s back… and this time, it brought a BIG BOMB!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Minesweeper: Big Bomb, you’ll still flip tiles and use numbers to deduce where the mines are hiding. But wait—this time, it’s not just about tiptoeing around danger. You’ll also decide when to unleash the Big Bomb and blow everything sky high!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you play it safe? Or gamble it all in one fiery blast? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Big Bomb Mode <i>(IN A NEW WAY)</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse Minesweeper – detonate everything! Your goal is no longer to avoid the mines, but to boldly blow them all up! But beware—hidden among the countless small mines is a single, devastating Big Bomb waiting to surprise you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/192bc58e22b23742decda38e94f1a3a2.poster.avif?t=1763736521\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/192bc58e22b23742decda38e94f1a3a2.webm?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/192bc58e22b23742decda38e94f1a3a2.mp4?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Nostalgia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The traditional Minesweeper you grew up with, now with a twist. From beginner-friendly puzzles to hellish challenges across dozens of difficulty levels—can you conquer them all? And don’t get too comfortable, because the lurking Big Bomb adds a fresh layer of chaos to even the classics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/ef58a27d5e28c5f9c1e48104686ac901.poster.avif?t=1763736521\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/ef58a27d5e28c5f9c1e48104686ac901.webm?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/ef58a27d5e28c5f9c1e48104686ac901.mp4?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your limits in extreme modes, chase your fastest times and highest combos, and keep smashing your personal bests!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/bf25778ea9c8b8d5ce9f92742219eb50.poster.avif?t=1763736521\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/bf25778ea9c8b8d5ce9f92742219eb50.webm?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/bf25778ea9c8b8d5ce9f92742219eb50.mp4?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skins &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the same old gray tiles? Unlock a massive collection of custom skins for mines, flags, tiles, and backgrounds! Build your own one-of-a-kind battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/8a8be466d955083432d554efc89fc4a3.poster.avif?t=1763736521\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/8a8be466d955083432d554efc89fc4a3.webm?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/8a8be466d955083432d554efc89fc4a3.mp4?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helpful Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Too tough? Don’t worry! We’ve got handy power-ups to assist both newbies and hardcore veterans.<i>(No 30sec AD here)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/79a40f2f226dd3cf380128b943814be9.poster.avif?t=1763736521\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/79a40f2f226dd3cf380128b943814be9.webm?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/79a40f2f226dd3cf380128b943814be9.mp4?t=1763736521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because… Minesweeper never goes out of style, and the old days in your memory, they backed with some new things.</p>",
